---
title: Toys
layout: index
bodyClass: toys-index
override:tags: []
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<p>
  Small graphics experiments I have built just for fun.
</p>
<p>
  No agent vibes, here&mdash;these are an excuse for me to enjoy the act of writing code.</p>
</p>

<div class="toy-gallery">
  <ul class="toy-grid">
  {% for toy in collections.toys %}
    {% set toyEmbed = toy.data.toyEmbed %}
    {% set toySize = 128 %}
    {% set toyTitle = toy.data.title %}
    <li class="toy-card">
      {% include "toy-player.njk" %}
      <span class="toy-card-name">{{ toy.data.title }}</span>
      <a class="toy-card-link" href="{{ toy.url }}" aria-label="View {{ toy.data.title }}"></a>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
